4,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"392160","steamName":"X4: Foundations","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/392160/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:09:16.599396+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Your journey to building a vast space empire begins behind the controls of a single ship. Explore, trade, fight, and build as you rise to command fleets, stations, and entire economies in a living, fully simulated universe that reacts to every decision.","detailedDescription":"Start Small. Command Everything.\nYour journey begins with a single ship - but what you become is up to you.\n\nTrade, fight, explore, and build your way to power as you grow from a lone pilot into the leader of a vast space empire. Command fleets, manage resources, and shape the future of the galaxy through your decisions.\n\nA Living, Simulated Universe\nThe universe of X4 is fully simulated and constantly evolving.\n\nFactions trade, build, and wage war independently, reacting dynamically to both your actions and each other. Every station, ship, and economy is part of a living system that continues to grow - with or without your influence.\n\nBuild Your Empire\nConstruct space stations, establish trade networks, and control entire production chains.\n\nDesign and expand your infrastructure using a modular system, building stations that power your economy, manage supply chains, and automate production as your empire grows into a self-sustaining powerhouse.\n\nFight and Command\nEngage in real-time combat and take direct control of your ships - or command entire fleets strategically.\n\nFrom small skirmishes to large-scale battles, every encounter is shaped by your tactics and decisions.\n\nA Universe in Motion\n\n• Thousands of ships and stations carry out their tasks\n\n• Factions build and expand stations\n\n• Trade routes evolve as the economy develops\n\n• Instigate war or broker peace through subterfuge and diplomacy\n\nA Universe That Keeps Evolving\nX4: Foundations continues to grow with major updates and expansions that introduce new systems, mechanics, and opportunities for players. Make the universe your own alongside a thriving modding community.\n\nWhether you’re returning or starting fresh, there’s never been a better time to build your empire.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/392160/header.jpg?t=1783002135"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/392160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783002135"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/392160/ss_a8ad176e9247f18818191a156ecfb4a4ef9d320e.600x338.jpg?t=1783002135","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/392160/ss_a8ad176e9247f18818191a156ecfb4a4ef9d320e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783002135"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/392160/ab7a9c6dbdf0eaaa30ef7798164078df8b066aeb/ss_ab7a9c6dbdf0eaaa30ef7798164078df8b066aeb.600x338.jpg?t=1783002135","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/392160/ab7a9c6dbdf0eaaa30ef7798164078df8b066aeb/ss_ab7a9c6dbdf0eaaa30ef7798164078df8b066aeb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783002135"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea